{"h":3209,"w":2400,"lines":[{"x":0.06407767023019488,"w":0.015533979733784994,"y":0.38808139518416829,"c":1,"t":"G","h":0.01308139551465759},{"y":0.037066500530405722,"h":0.016393092265381659,"c":1,"x":0.81526979301542302,"w":0.082125345865885491,"t":"Reading"},{"h":0.017463594953590511,"y":0.087209302204893868,"w":0.77669901529947916,"c":1,"x":0.10873787120327469,"t":"Later that year Abner Doble delivered unhappy news to those eagerly awaiting the delivery"},{"h":0.01757136133972359,"y":0.10610465103996081,"c":1,"x":0.10873785506658483,"t":"of their modern new cars. Those buyers who received the handful of completed cars","w":0.71650487263997398},{"c":1,"h":0.017519742306147834,"y":0.12492211826521937,"t":"complained that the vehicles were sluggish and erratic, sometimes going in reverse when","w":0.75728154500325506,"x":0.10873786825594085},{"w":0.76893203735351556,"h":0.021939977010091094,"c":1,"y":0.1409883716823106,"x":0.10679611709994125,"t":"they should go forward. The new engine design, though innovative, was still plagued with"},{"h":0.016199376947040434,"x":0.10679611615879532,"c":1,"t":"serious glitches.","y":0.16417445500510863,"w":0.14368932088216146},{"t":"The brothers made one final attempt to produce a viable steam automobile. In early","h":0.01750434625928643,"y":0.19906542048090803,"w":0.70873784383138017,"c":1,"x":0.10873788257460092},{"c":1,"x":0.10868976331123473,"w":0.73990000406901046,"y":0.21738308669998341,"t":"1924, the Doble brothers shipped a Model E to New York City to be road-tested by the","h":0.019652263249192337},{"x":0.10873786469988413,"w":0.76893203735351567,"h":0.01744186068621012,"c":1,"t":"Automobile Club of America. After sitting overnight in freezing temperatures, the car was","y":0.23691860453420344},{"h":0.017492574174827524,"t":"pushed out into the road and left to sit for over an hour in the frosty morning air. At the","y":0.25576323988652439,"c":1,"w":0.7417475891113281,"x":0.10873785584553085},{"t":"turn of the key, the boiler lit and reached its operating pressure inside of forty seconds.","y":0.27274556350775758,"x":0.10673740891148337,"w":0.74185419718424472,"h":0.020714742595161706,"c":1},{"y":0.29211318515064555,"w":0.75932118733723941,"h":0.019714954411872099,"x":0.10868752282490098,"c":1,"t":"As they drove the test vehicle further, they found that its evenly distributed weight lent it"},{"t":"surprisingly good handling, even though it was so heavy. As the new Doble steamer was","y":0.30805311026436422,"c":1,"x":0.1085756589943758,"h":0.023553094834182109,"w":0.75369069417317691},{"c":1,"t":"further developed and tested, its maximum speed was pushed to over a hundred miles per","w":0.76320612589518233,"x":0.10868890868481827,"y":0.32980385482346408,"h":0.019552998527930909},{"w":0.76901443481445309,"x":0.10868702735389624,"h":0.02006273834133443,"c":1,"t":"hour, and it achieved about fifteen miles per gallon of kerosene with negligible emissions.","y":0.34776381417827751},{"w":0.71866455078124991,"x":0.10863716295018605,"c":1,"t":"Sadly, the Dobles' brilliant steam car never was a financial success. Priced at around","y":0.3825935260942217,"h":0.021731479442751001},{"c":1,"h":0.021153496953185802,"x":0.10867905148170508,"w":0.75352193196614581,"y":0.40363572601019071,"t":"$18,000 in 1924, it was popular only among the very wealthy. Plus, it is said that no two"},{"t":"Model Es were quite the same, because Abner Doble tinkered endlessly with the design. By","y":0.42281765101712088,"w":0.78068201700846351,"x":0.11062785642205673,"c":1,"h":0.019632842161945163},{"t":"the time the company folded in 1931, fewer than fifty of the amazing Model E steam cars","w":0.76310679117838542,"h":0.017453633364858723,"c":1,"x":0.10873786644035306,"y":0.44330218069648497},{"w":0.75169962565104165,"t":"had been produced. For his whole career, until his death in 1961, Abner Doble remained","x":0.10862907467698714,"y":0.45911430116261442,"h":0.022248807057413389,"c":1},{"h":0.0188953482844747,"t":"adamant that steam-powered automobiles were at least equal to gasoline cars, if not","c":1,"y":0.47965116305632893,"w":0.71456309000651042,"x":0.10873787264678896},{"x":0.10866822206704806,"y":0.49782274484602573,"w":0.77102208455403631,"h":0.020570509010386262,"c":1,"t":"superior. Given the evidence, he may have been right. Many of the Model E Dobles which"},{"x":0.10873785580118607,"w":0.7417475891113281,"h":0.019003115264797477,"t":"have survived are still in good working condition, some having been driven over half a","c":1,"y":0.51588785033872542},{"y":0.53633720918948979,"h":0.017556872026199821,"x":0.1087378708982817,"t":"million miles with only normal maintenance. Astonishingly, an unmodified Doble Model E","c":1,"w":0.77669901529947916},{"y":0.55367496803317984,"w":0.77488815307617187,"t":"runs clean enough to pass the emissions laws in California today, and they are pretty strict.","x":0.1086607022134846,"h":0.020759499332986486,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.78261800130208325,"t":"It is true that the technology poses some difficult problems, but you cannot help but wonder","y":0.57262075846008476,"x":0.10869173492141773,"h":0.019420687951774318},{"w":0.74563105265299479,"x":0.10873787177672189,"h":0.017464500498548863,"c":1,"y":0.59156976732213362,"t":"how efficient a steam car might be with the benefit of modern materials and computers."},{"y":0.610465116551831,"w":0.76893203735351578,"c":1,"h":0.018895348284474811,"t":"Under the current pressure to improve automotive performance and reduce emissions, it is","x":0.11067961234006579},{"x":0.1086391539367717,"t":"not unthinkable that the steam car may rise again.","y":0.62924376209263477,"w":0.42736053466796875,"h":0.019254148489218248,"c":1},{"t":"67","c":1,"y":0.95494186032770034,"w":0.031067959467569906,"x":0.87184466092964541,"h":0.013081395514657479}]}